# Code-injection smoke test (decomp/src/ezgb_tab_banner.c).
#
# $748a is EzgbTabBanner's `ret` — the last instruction of the injected
# function, so breaking here proves the body ran to completion, not just that
# the hook transferred control. (Breaking at the $746b entry also works but
# false-fires: SameBoy breakpoints are address-only, and other ROM banks have
# live code at $746b.)
#
# The examine dumps read the BG tilemap's top row, where the function draws
# its marker to the right of the " SD " / " SET " / " HELP " tabs.
breakpoint $748a
continue
